BUILD A COMPLETE RCF FELLOWSHIP WEBSITE — REAL, FUNCTIONAL, FAST & DEPLOYABLE

Build a complete, production-minded, mobile-first website for RCF (Redeemed Christian Fellowship). This is a real church fellowship website, not a demo, mockup, template preview, or static landing page.

The website should be beautiful, modern, fast, simple, easy for students to use on mobile phones, and fully connected to Firebase.

The main purpose of this website is:

1. Allow members to register quickly.
2. Allow members to share testimonies using beautiful social-media-style colored text cards.
3. Allow authorized administrators to view all submitted testimonies, including the author and exact submission date/time.
4. Allow administrators to organize testimonies for Sunday fellowship.
5. Connect the website to LastWord through a configurable link.
6. Deploy the website through GitHub and Vercel.

Do not overcomplicate the application. Prioritize speed, simplicity, beautiful UI, working functionality, and security.

